<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'About Us', description: 'Pioneering Advanced Filter Media Technology Since 1990. Learn more about Aurora Filtech\'s manufacturing excellence and specialized plants.', path: '/about.html' }) %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/header', { path: '/about.html' }) %>

    <section class="hero" style="padding: 80px 0; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-surface), var(--border-color));">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">About Aurora Filtech</h1>
            <p style="margin: 0 auto; max-width: 600px; color: var(--text-muted);">Pioneering Advanced Filter Media Technology Since 1990</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-preview">
                <div class="about-text" style="font-size: 1.1rem;">
                    <span class="subtitle" style="color: var(--primary-color); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 700;">Who We Are</span>
                    <h2 style="margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 30px;">Leading the Industry.</h2>
                    <p>Aurora Filtech is a premier group company with three specialized plants and over a decade of dedicated experience in the filtration industry. We focus on researching and developing advanced filter media using the most cutting-edge materials to meet the rigorous requirements of our global customers.</p>
                    <p>Unlike many competitors, we own our proprietary <strong>monofilament technology</strong>. This capability allows us to produce high-performance yarns—including PPS, TEFLON, and anti-hydrolytic variants—in-house. This vertical integration ensures we can strictly control quality from the raw material stage.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="about-img" style="background-image: url('assets/hero_bg.png');" role="img" aria-label="Production Line Facility"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" style="background-color: var(--bg-surface);">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">Manufacturing Excellence</h2>
                <span class="subtitle" style="color: var(--primary-color); font-weight: 600;">State of the Art Facilities</span>
            </div>
            <div class="products-grid">
                <div class="product-card" style="padding: 30px; display: block; border-top: 4px solid var(--primary-color);">
                    <h3 style="color: var(--text-color); margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1.3rem;">German Technology</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">Equipped with 100+ imported looms and computer-controlled systems from Germany and Sweden to ensure uniform tension and flawless fabric surfaces.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="product-card" style="padding: 30px; display: block; border-top: 4px solid var(--primary-color);">
                    <h3 style="color: var(--text-color); margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1.3rem;">Heat Setting</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">Our 7-meter wide heat setting machine features 2 heating modes. With rollers up to 80cm in diameter, we achieve larger stretching strength.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="product-card" style="padding: 30px; display: block; border-top: 4px solid var(--primary-color);">
                    <h3 style="color: var(--text-color); margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1.3rem;">Automated Jointing</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">Full-automatic joint machines save time and offer greater accuracy than manual labor, ensuring the joint is 100% perfect.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
